# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` and fill in:   cp .env.example .env
#
# Only the Fastify BFF reads this file. Nothing here is prefixed with VITE_,
# so none of it is ever inlined into the browser bundle — the API key stays
# on the server. `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` is committed and
# contains no real values.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Required for the AI assistant. Create one at:
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#
# Without it the server still starts: the dashboard renders in full and the
# assistant reports itself as unconfigured instead of failing.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ── Optional overrides ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Model used by the AI assistant.
# ASSISTANT_MODEL=claude-opus-5

# Reasoning effort: low | medium | high | xhigh | max
# Lower is faster and cheaper. This app is tuned for a snappy chat.
# ASSISTANT_EFFORT=medium

# Ceiling on answer length, including reasoning tokens.
# ASSISTANT_MAX_TOKENS=8192

# Port the BFF listens on. The Vite dev server proxies /api here.
# PORT=8787

# Allowed browser origin for CORS.
# WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# The dashboard's data is generated, not fetched. Changing the seed produces a
# different person's year; changing the length changes how much history the
# trend charts have. Both are fixed at boot.
# DATASET_SEED=20260918
# DATASET_DAYS=90
